<title>BULGARIA: NO BIDS RECEIVED FOR BULGARIA'S 9-, 12-MTH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NO BIDS RECEIVED FOR BULGARIA'S 9-, 12-MTH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>No bids were received for</p>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry floater coupon T-bill issues with</p>
<p>maturities of nine and 12 months respectively, the central bank</p>
<p>said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issues were offered with no par value or minimum</p>
<p>acceptable price set in advance for Monday's auctions.</p>
<p>The coupons were set equal to the central bank's main</p>
<p>interest rate for the period to maturity. The main rate is now</p>
<p>set at 14.15 percent monthly or 169.80 percent annually.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number    BG3027397028	BG3027497026</p>
<p> Term		nine months	 12 months</p>
<p> Auction date    April 14	    April 14</p>
<p> Issue date	April 16	    April 16</p>
<p> Maturity date   January 14, 1998  April 15, 1998</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
